        "width": 218.3709186351706,
        "height": 90.97700787401574,
        "left": 364.7122309711286,
        "top": 215.55821522309708,
        "content": "O'zbekiston armiyasining muvaffaqiyati, zamonaviy qurollar va uskunalarga asoslanadi. Barcha harbiy xizmatchilar uchun professional tayyorgarlik zarur.",
        "fontSize": 13,
